IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q24-RUNNING-BALANCE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(10).
01 WS-N PIC 9(4).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4).
01 WS-RECORD PIC X(30).
01 WS-TYPE PIC X.
01 WS-AMOUNT-TEXT PIC X(15).
01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-BALANCE
    ACCEPT WS-N
    PERFORM VARYING WS-COUNT FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-COUNT > WS-N
        ACCEPT WS-RECORD
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-TYPE WS-AMOUNT-TEXT
        UNSTRING WS-RECORD DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE
            INTO WS-TYPE WS-AMOUNT-TEXT
        END-UNSTRING
        IF FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(WS-AMOUNT-TEXT) = 0
            COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-AMOUNT-TEXT)
            IF WS-TYPE = 'C'
                ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE
                DISPLAY WS-BALANCE
            ELSE
                IF WS-TYPE = 'D'
                    IF WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE
                        SUBTRACT WS-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE
                        DISPLAY WS-BALANCE
                    ELSE
                        DISPLAY "REJECTED: " WS-BALANCE
                    END-IF
                ELSE
                    DISPLAY "INVALID TRANSACTION TYPE"
                END-IF
            END-IF
        ELSE
            DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.
